<odoo>
    <template id="s_arqora_services" name="Arqora Services List">
<section class="aq-s s_arqora_services aq-sec" style="padding-top:0" data-name="Services List">
  <div class="aq-container">
    <header class="aq-sheet"><b>S–01</b><span>What we do</span><span>Six services, one team</span></header>
    <ol class="aq-svc" data-stagger=""><li class="aq-svc__row"><span class="aq-svc__no">01</span><h2 class="aq-svc__title">Lighting concept</h2><p class="aq-svc__text">We study the architecture, how each space is used and how it should feel, then compose the layers of ambient, accent and decorative light.</p><ul class="aq-svc__list"><li>Mood and scene design</li><li>Layered lighting plans</li><li>Fixture selection</li></ul></li><li class="aq-svc__row"><span class="aq-svc__no">02</span><h2 class="aq-svc__title">Calculations &amp; photometrics</h2><p class="aq-svc__text">Our engineers model every room to confirm light levels, uniformity and glare before a single fixture is ordered.</p><ul class="aq-svc__list"><li>DIALux and Relux studies</li><li>Lux plans and UGR reports</li><li>Energy estimates</li></ul></li><li class="aq-svc__row"><span class="aq-svc__no">03</span><h2 class="aq-svc__title">Bespoke fixtures</h2><p class="aq-svc__text">Custom sizes, finishes and one-off pieces, designed in our studio and prototyped with our artisan partners.</p><ul class="aq-svc__list"><li>Scaled and resized designs</li><li>Custom finishes and patinas</li><li>One-off sculptural pieces</li></ul></li><li class="aq-svc__row"><span class="aq-svc__no">04</span><h2 class="aq-svc__title">Samples &amp; mock-ups</h2><p class="aq-svc__text">See and touch the result before you specify it: finish boxes for the studio and full-scale mock-ups on site.</p><ul class="aq-svc__list"><li>Finish sample boxes</li><li>On-site lighting mock-ups</li><li>Prototype reviews</li></ul></li><li class="aq-svc__row"><span class="aq-svc__no">05</span><h2 class="aq-svc__title">Specification &amp; BIM</h2><p class="aq-svc__text">Everything the project team needs to specify with confidence, issued and kept up to date through every revision.</p><ul class="aq-svc__list"><li>Revit families and CAD</li><li>IES photometric files</li><li>Specification schedules</li></ul></li><li class="aq-svc__row"><span class="aq-svc__no">06</span><h2 class="aq-svc__title">Installation &amp; commissioning</h2><p class="aq-svc__text">We support installers on site, then programme, focus and fine-tune every scene until the space looks as it was designed.</p><ul class="aq-svc__list"><li>Pre-installation meetings</li><li>DALI and Casambi programming</li><li>Focusing and scene setting</li></ul></li></ol>
  </div>
</section>
    </template>
